              "doc": "<p>Compute the per-link capsule segment endpoints (a, b) in world frame.</p><h4>Example</h4><div class=\"doc__code\" data-copy-scope><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"color:var(--fg-dim)\">python</span><span class=\"code-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-toggle\" data-code-toggle aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show full code\">Full</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy copy--swap\" data-copy-from=\"[data-code-full]\" title=\"Copy\"><span class=\"t\"></span><span class=\"o\"></span></button></span></div><pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; from robot_descriptions.loaders.yourdfpy import load_robot_description\n&gt;&gt;&gt; robot = Robot.load(load_robot_description(\"panda_description\"))\n&gt;&gt;&gt; state = robot.state()\n&gt;&gt;&gt; robot.transform_collision_capsules(state) is state  # no link capsules loaded\nTrue</pre><pre data-code-full hidden>from robokit.robo.robot import Robot\n\nfrom robot_descriptions.loaders.yourdfpy import load_robot_description\nrobot = Robot.load(load_robot_description(\"panda_description\"))\nstate = robot.state()\nrobot.transform_collision_capsules(state) is state  # no link capsules loaded</pre></div>",
