              "signature": "accept(accept_mask: ArrayLike, proposed: RobotState) -> RobotState",
              "source": "https://github.com/openrobokit/robokit/blob/main/src/robokit/robo/robot_state.py#L448",
              "doc": "<p>Optimized accept: copies q, and the forward kinematics this state already had (1 kernel).</p>",
