          "doc": "<p>Concatenate weighted residuals, with optional threshold-based selection scoring.</p><p>Modes:</p><ul><li>Without <code>thresholds</code>: ordinary residual concatenation for optimization.</li><li>With <code>thresholds</code>: bounded children are constraints; children with None thresholds are scores.</li></ul><p>Selection sequence:</p><ol><li>Require each constraint's absolute residuals to satisfy scalar, per-row or repeating bounds.</li><li>Return score norm for valid rows and infinity otherwise, preserving ordinary squared costs on valid rows.</li><li>Count valid rows per <code>num_candidates</code> group in <code>valid_count</code>; use stable selection to preserve ties.</li></ol><h3>Example</h3><div class=\"doc__code\" data-copy-scope><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"color:var(--fg-dim)\">python</span><span class=\"code-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-toggle\" data-code-toggle aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show full code\">Full</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy copy--swap\" data-copy-from=\"[data-code-full]\" title=\"Copy\"><span class=\"t\"></span><span class=\"o\"></span></button></span></div><pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; from robokit.terms.dense.configuration_task import ConfigurationTask\n&gt;&gt;&gt; task = CompositeTask([ConfigurationTask()], thresholds=[None])\n&gt;&gt;&gt; task.residual_dim\n1</pre><pre data-code-full hidden>from robokit.terms.composite_task import CompositeTask\n\nfrom robokit.terms.dense.configuration_task import ConfigurationTask\ntask = CompositeTask([ConfigurationTask()], thresholds=[None])\ntask.residual_dim</pre></div>",
