              "doc": "<p>Run the planner in closed loop on <code>sim</code>, one world per instance, for <code>num_steps</code> sim steps: each control period plans from <code>sim</code>'s state, then steps <code>sim</code> through the commands, mapped by the config's <code>control_map</code> and clipped to the controls MuJoCo applies, and calls <code>callback</code> with every instance's plan info.</p>",
