          "anchor": "sim-context",
          "doc": "<p>The <code>SimContext</code> values of a simulator's worlds, with its <code>mjm</code>'s layout, except <code>CLOCK</code>, <code>NUM_INSTANCES</code> and <code>WORLDS_PER_INSTANCE</code>.</p>",
