          "module": "robokit.sim",
          "source": "https://github.com/openrobokit/robokit/blob/main/src/robokit/sim/__init__.py#L22",
          "anchor": "sim",
          "doc": "<p>What <code>MjWarpSim</code> and <code>newton.NewtonSim</code> offer: device work only, also in a capture on Warp's current stream.</p>",
