              "name": "build_entity",
              "signature": "build_entity(prefix: str, soft_joint_pos_limit_factor: float = 1.0) -> Entity",
              "source": "https://github.com/openrobokit/robokit/blob/main/src/robokit/sim/mjwarp.py#L337",
              "doc": "<p>The <code>robokit.sim.mjentity.Entity</code> named <code>prefix*</code>, its default pose the initial <code>qpos</code>.</p><h4>Example</h4><div class=\"doc__code\" data-copy-scope><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"color:var(--fg-dim)\">python</span><span class=\"code-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-toggle\" data-code-toggle aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show full code\">Full</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy copy--swap\" data-copy-from=\"[data-code-full]\" title=\"Copy\"><span class=\"t\"></span><span class=\"o\"></span></button></span></div><pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; xml = '&lt;mujoco&gt;&lt;worldbody&gt;&lt;body name=\"r/base\" pos=\"0 0 .5\"&gt;&lt;freejoint name=\"r/root\"/&gt;&lt;geom size=\".1\"/&gt;'\n&gt;&gt;&gt; xml += '&lt;body&gt;&lt;joint name=\"r/a\"/&gt;&lt;geom size=\".1\"/&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/worldbody&gt;&lt;/mujoco&gt;'\n&gt;&gt;&gt; robot = MjWarpSim(mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_string(xml), nworld=2).build_entity(\"r/\")\n&gt;&gt;&gt; robot.joint_names, robot.data.default_root_state[:3].tolist()\n(['a'], [0.0, 0.0, 0.5])</pre><pre data-code-full hidden>import mujoco\nfrom robokit.sim.mjwarp import MjWarpSim\n\nxml = '&lt;mujoco&gt;&lt;worldbody&gt;&lt;body name=\"r/base\" pos=\"0 0 .5\"&gt;&lt;freejoint name=\"r/root\"/&gt;&lt;geom size=\".1\"/&gt;'\nxml += '&lt;body&gt;&lt;joint name=\"r/a\"/&gt;&lt;geom size=\".1\"/&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/worldbody&gt;&lt;/mujoco&gt;'\nrobot = MjWarpSim(mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_string(xml), nworld=2).build_entity(\"r/\")\nrobot.joint_names, robot.data.default_root_state[:3].tolist()</pre></div>",
