              "source": "https://github.com/openrobokit/robokit/blob/main/src/robokit/sim/mjwarp.py#L367",
              "doc": "<p>(nworld, dim): sensor <code>name</code>'s readings, a zero-copy torch view of <code>data.sensordata</code>.</p><h4>Example</h4><div class=\"doc__code\" data-copy-scope><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"color:var(--fg-dim)\">python</span><span class=\"code-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-toggle\" data-code-toggle aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show full code\">Full</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy copy--swap\" data-copy-from=\"[data-code-full]\" title=\"Copy\"><span class=\"t\"></span><span class=\"o\"></span></button></span></div><pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; xml = '&lt;mujoco&gt;&lt;worldbody&gt;&lt;body name=\"b\" pos=\"0 0 .5\"&gt;&lt;freejoint/&gt;&lt;geom size=\".1\"/&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/worldbody&gt;'\n&gt;&gt;&gt; xml += '&lt;sensor&gt;&lt;framepos name=\"p\" objtype=\"body\" objname=\"b\"/&gt;&lt;/sensor&gt;&lt;/mujoco&gt;'\n&gt;&gt;&gt; MjWarpSim(mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_string(xml), nworld=2).get_sensor(\"p\").tolist()\n[[0.0, 0.0, 0.5], [0.0, 0.0, 0.5]]</pre><pre data-code-full hidden>import mujoco\nfrom robokit.sim.mjwarp import MjWarpSim\n\nxml = '&lt;mujoco&gt;&lt;worldbody&gt;&lt;body name=\"b\" pos=\"0 0 .5\"&gt;&lt;freejoint/&gt;&lt;geom size=\".1\"/&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/worldbody&gt;'\nxml += '&lt;sensor&gt;&lt;framepos name=\"p\" objtype=\"body\" objname=\"b\"/&gt;&lt;/sensor&gt;&lt;/mujoco&gt;'\nMjWarpSim(mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_string(xml), nworld=2).get_sensor(\"p\").tolist()</pre></div>",
