              "name": "set_scene",
              "signature": "set_scene(mask: wp.array, scene: wp.array)",
              "source": "https://github.com/openrobokit/robokit/blob/main/src/robokit/sim/mjwarp.py#L501",
              "doc": "<p>Give the worlds where <code>mask</code> is set scene <code>scene[w]</code>'s model rows; their static geoms move at <code>reset()</code>.</p><h4>Example</h4><div class=\"doc__code\" data-copy-scope><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"color:var(--fg-dim)\">python</span><span class=\"code-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-toggle\" data-code-toggle aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show full code\">Full</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy copy--swap\" data-copy-from=\"[data-code-full]\" title=\"Copy\"><span class=\"t\"></span><span class=\"o\"></span></button></span></div><pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; xml = '&lt;mujoco&gt;&lt;worldbody&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;freejoint/&gt;&lt;geom size=\".1\"/&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/worldbody&gt;&lt;/mujoco&gt;'\n&gt;&gt;&gt; scenes = [mujoco.MjSpec.from_string(xml), mujoco.MjSpec.from_string(xml.replace(\".1\", \".2\"))]\n&gt;&gt;&gt; sim = MjWarpSim(scenes, nworld=[2, 2])\n&gt;&gt;&gt; sim.set_scene(wp.array([True, False, False, False]), wp.array([1, 0, 0, 0], dtype=int))\n&gt;&gt;&gt; (sim.model.geom_size.numpy()[:, 0, 0] &gt; 0.15).tolist()  # world 0: the big ball\n[True, False, True, True]</pre><pre data-code-full hidden>import mujoco\nimport warp as wp\nfrom robokit.sim.mjwarp import MjWarpSim\n\nxml = '&lt;mujoco&gt;&lt;worldbody&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;freejoint/&gt;&lt;geom size=\".1\"/&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/worldbody&gt;&lt;/mujoco&gt;'\nscenes = [mujoco.MjSpec.from_string(xml), mujoco.MjSpec.from_string(xml.replace(\".1\", \".2\"))]\nsim = MjWarpSim(scenes, nworld=[2, 2])\nsim.set_scene(wp.array([True, False, False, False]), wp.array([1, 0, 0, 0], dtype=int))\n(sim.model.geom_size.numpy()[:, 0, 0] &gt; 0.15).tolist()  # world 0: the big ball</pre></div>",
