              "doc": "<p>Accumulate this term into shared normal-equation buffers.</p><h4>Lifecycle</h4><ol><li>Prepare term state and reusable buffers.</li><li>Evaluate residuals and, for a build step, the Jacobian.</li><li>Reduce into cost, <code>JᵀJ</code>, and <code>Jᵀr</code>.</li></ol>",
