              "source": "https://github.com/openrobokit/robokit/blob/main/src/robokit/helpers/humanoid_retargeting/config.py#L652",
              "doc": "<p>Return a named task; raise KeyError when absent.</p><div class=\"doc__code\" data-copy-scope><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"color:var(--fg-dim)\">python</span><span class=\"code-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-toggle\" data-code-toggle aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show full code\">Full</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy copy--swap\" data-copy-from=\"[data-code-full]\" title=\"Copy\"><span class=\"t\"></span><span class=\"o\"></span></button></span></div><pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; from robokit.terms.dense.configuration_task import ConfigurationTask\n&gt;&gt;&gt; config = HumanoidRetargeterOfflineConfig(terms=[]).add(ConfigurationTask(weight=0.2), name=\"rest\")\n&gt;&gt;&gt; config.task(\"rest\").weight\n0.2</pre><pre data-code-full hidden>from robokit.helpers.humanoid_retargeting.config import HumanoidRetargeterOfflineConfig\n\nfrom robokit.terms.dense.configuration_task import ConfigurationTask\nconfig = HumanoidRetargeterOfflineConfig(terms=[]).add(ConfigurationTask(weight=0.2), name=\"rest\")\nconfig.task(\"rest\").weight</pre></div>",
