              "source": "https://github.com/openrobokit/robokit/blob/main/src/robokit/helpers/hand_retargeting/offline.py#L243",
              "doc": "<p>Set one positive pairwise target scale per warmed trajectory without rebuilding the solver.</p><h4>Example</h4><div class=\"doc__code\" data-copy-scope><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"color:var(--fg-dim)\">python</span><span class=\"code-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-toggle\" data-code-toggle aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show full code\">Full</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy copy--swap\" data-copy-from=\"[data-code-full]\" title=\"Copy\"><span class=\"t\"></span><span class=\"o\"></span></button></span></div><pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; from robokit.helpers.full_body_retargeting import FullBodyRetargeter\n&gt;&gt;&gt; from robokit.helpers.hand_retargeting.presets.inspire import offline, spec\n&gt;&gt;&gt; solver = HandRetargeterOffline(offline, FullBodyRetargeter().hand_robot(\"right\"), spec)\n&gt;&gt;&gt; solver.warmup(2, 3)\n&gt;&gt;&gt; solver.set_target_scales(np.array([0.9, 1.2]))</pre><pre data-code-full hidden>import numpy as np\nfrom robokit.helpers.hand_retargeting.offline import HandRetargeterOffline\n\nfrom robokit.helpers.full_body_retargeting import FullBodyRetargeter\nfrom robokit.helpers.hand_retargeting.presets.inspire import offline, spec\nsolver = HandRetargeterOffline(offline, FullBodyRetargeter().hand_robot(\"right\"), spec)\nsolver.warmup(2, 3)\nsolver.set_target_scales(np.array([0.9, 1.2]))</pre></div>",
